---
label: .gitattributes
description: LF line endings for every text file, whatever system it's checked out on
file: .gitattributes
whole-file: yes
order: 12
section: git
---
# Text files are stored and checked out with LF; Windows batch files keep CRLF, which cmd needs.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# Never merged or diffed as text
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.ttf binary
*.wav binary
*.ogg binary
